# Casa de las Puas (Pueblo Cantera), 9 x 7, interior (F2, contract 74; map id 180). column = i, row = j. A hedgehog lover's room: round cushions (stools) on the floor, a bed, bookshelves and a planter of prickly pears.
# In-game trade (quillix -> quillia): he wants a QUILLIX and gives a QUILLIA whose nickname is the fixed ASCII text `tr_pua.nick` (the same in all four languages: the trade idiom of casa_mimo,
# contract 32.5). Flag 928 = the trade was done.
@map casa_puas
@size 9 7
@interior yes
@flag pua_done 928
@var pua_res 5
@var pua_want 6
@var pua_give 7
@bg 3
@fill floor_wood
@spawn door 4 5 N
@legend
  .  tile=floor_wood
  C  tile=none object=wall_corner
  w  tile=none object=wall_j
  y  tile=none object=wall_win_j
  |  tile=none object=wall_i
  q  tile=none object=wall_win_i
  B  object=bookshelf interact=look text=casa.books
  b  object=bed
  S  object=stool
  P  object=planter
  G  npc=chica id=trader face=SW script=trader
  m  tile=mat
@grid
  Cwywwyyww
  |B.B.P..b
  |...G...b
  |.S...S..
  q........
  |.S......
  |...mm...
@warp m -> pueblo_cantera spawn=puas_door
@script trader npc
    npc_face_hero trader
    setv pua_want sp:quillix
    setv pua_give sp:quillia
    name_var 0 pua_want
    name_var 1 pua_give
    jf pua_done after
    say tr_pua.hello
    ask trueque.ask
    jv 0 1 go
    say trueque.no
    end
  go:
    trade quillix quillia tr_pua.nick pua_res
    jv pua_res 1 done
    jv pua_res 255 cancel
    say trueque.wrong
    end
  cancel:
    say trueque.no
    end
  done:
    setf pua_done
    say trueque.done
    end
  after:
    name_var 0 pua_give
    say trueque.after
@end
